  "contentHtml": "<p>유발하라리의 &#39;호모데우스&#39;에는&#160;</p><p>다음과 같은 이야기가 있습니다.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 63.8605%; height: 252px;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 252px;\"><td style=\"width: 31.9307%; height: 252px; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/03baa1a0b8de952261b497118279dadd2da383a4\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"178\" height=\"251\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/03baa1a0b8de952261b497118279dadd2da383a4\" data-origin-width=\"386\" data-origin-height=\"545\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 29.4995%; height: 252px;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"> 경험하면 기록하라.</span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">기록하면 업로드하라.</span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">업로드하면 공유하라.</span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; -530쪽-</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa7d0d2fe1efe9586eb66a05813bc244b06dee66\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa7d0d2fe1efe9586eb66a05813bc244b06dee66\" data-origin-width=\"798\" data-origin-height=\"694\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f08fcdbbe348216b38b50d88e67487fb31164b34\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f08fcdbbe348216b38b50d88e67487fb31164b34\" data-origin-width=\"808\" data-origin-height=\"648\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>지난 25년간</p><p>꾸준히 이어간</p><p>&#39;재과만의 정신&#39;은</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>기억을 넘어서 기록으로!</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>그리고</b></span><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>&#160;공유로!</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>오늘도</p><p>1만 7천명 재과만 회원들은</p><p>&#39;재과만의 정신&#39;을 함께 실천하고 있습니다!</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
